{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42240","headline":"避难东归依韵和黄秀才见寄 · 徐铉","name":"避难东归依韵和黄秀才见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚戚逢人问所之，东流相送向京畿。\n自甘逐客纫兰佩，不料平民着战衣。\n树带荒村春冷落，江澄霁色雾霏微。\n时危道丧无才术，空手徘徊不忍归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}